# Private dotenv file. install.sh copies this to ~/.config/shell-setup/env
# (mode 600) if that file does not exist yet. The copy is NOT in the repo, so
# put real secrets there, never in this example.
#
# Plain KEY=value lines, loaded into every interactive shell.
# Quote values that contain spaces or shell characters.

# EDITOR=nvim
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
